From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dead-Universe <Dead-Universe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:44:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add authenticated Windows file and folder clipboard copying

Copy-only native virtual files over paired HTTPS; user-token file reads, bounded chunks, lazy IStream access and session-scoped revocation.

Built and verified in Hyper-V Win11; independent maintenance patch on 5c3061568275170fcfa6e29856eac8f9739dda5e.

